WEBVTT

00:01:40.430 --> 00:01:43.680
The countdown has already begun!

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:45.390
Rena?

00:01:45.600 --> 00:01:47.980
Yui, it's okay.

00:01:57.070 --> 00:01:58.150
Too bad!

00:01:58.360 --> 00:02:00.240
It's not working...

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:01.740
Again!

00:02:07.870 --> 00:02:11.750
Let's see... How many minutes left again?

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:13.880
That's enough...

00:02:14.090 --> 00:02:15.550
Three!

00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:17.010
Two!

00:02:17.220 --> 00:02:18.420
One!

00:02:30.810 --> 00:02:34.570
In the name of Erinius, Alecto will prevail!

00:02:34.780 --> 00:02:37.530
Steel fangs, forged by darkness!

00:02:45.830 --> 00:02:47.620
Niero Assault!

00:02:59.970 --> 00:03:02.090
Did you think you'd won?

00:03:24.070 --> 00:03:25.830
How beautiful...

00:03:26.030 --> 00:03:28.750
It would have been even more beautiful at night.

00:03:54.980 --> 00:03:56.190
Rena?

00:04:10.200 --> 00:04:12.000
Rena! What's wrong?!

00:04:37.900 --> 00:04:39.110
Regalia?

00:04:39.610 --> 00:04:42.990
Aw, come on! That was the good part!

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.160
Oh well. With this one, it makes three.

00:04:45.360 --> 00:04:48.160
All the keys have come together.

00:05:39.080 --> 00:05:40.090
Rena!

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:55.770
Rena?

00:05:57.640 --> 00:05:58.770
Rena!

00:06:13.120 --> 00:06:14.700
What is that?!

00:07:11.260 --> 00:07:12.260
Rena!

00:07:34.450 --> 00:07:36.700
Who are you?

00:07:41.160 --> 00:07:42.370
Yui...

00:08:25.830 --> 00:08:27.290
That's enough.

00:08:27.500 --> 00:08:32.000
Come on, they're both here;
at least let me say hi to them.

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:37.390
Psh. All right, whatever.

00:08:50.610 --> 00:08:52.030
Tisis...

00:08:52.280 --> 00:08:55.110
I think Rena is okay now.

00:09:00.950 --> 00:09:03.410
It doesn't look like she can
talk right now, huh, Tia?

00:09:03.620 --> 00:09:04.410
Hmm...

00:09:04.620 --> 00:09:08.250
Sara! Let's go back to
that restaurant. I'm hungry!

00:09:08.460 --> 00:09:10.170
Okay, sounds good!

00:09:14.010 --> 00:09:15.220
Yui...

00:09:21.470 --> 00:09:23.480
I'm so glad you're safe.

00:09:36.360 --> 00:09:37.320
Theodore.

00:09:37.530 --> 00:09:38.530
Yes.

00:09:41.660 --> 00:09:45.000
It's exactly like the Fall
of Rimgarde, 12 years ago.

00:09:45.210 --> 00:09:48.000
And now there are these Regalia Gear...

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:52.210
They seem somehow similar to Rena's Regalia.

00:09:52.420 --> 00:09:55.670
But why did it suddenly
stop the fight and disappear?

00:09:55.880 --> 00:09:58.680
We are looking into that.

00:09:58.890 --> 00:10:01.260
And what of the other issue?

00:10:06.100 --> 00:10:08.730
We still haven't found definitive evidence.

00:10:08.940 --> 00:10:11.190
Pin down a location as soon as possible.

00:10:11.400 --> 00:10:12.400
Yes, ma'am.

00:10:14.320 --> 00:10:18.820
Um... Would it be possible to
go see the recovery work now?

00:10:21.320 --> 00:10:24.700
You must be very tired, Yui.
Why don't you rest for a bit?

00:10:24.910 --> 00:10:28.750
But things haven't settled down
and everyone is working so hard...

00:10:32.840 --> 00:10:34.130
If that's what you think,

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:37.130
there's a place you should visit tomorrow.

00:10:45.100 --> 00:10:46.310
Rena!

00:10:48.140 --> 00:10:50.310
Yui...

00:10:50.520 --> 00:10:51.400
Yui!

00:10:51.600 --> 00:10:53.900
Are you okay? Does it hurt at all?

00:10:54.110 --> 00:10:56.900
I'm fine. Thanks to you.

00:10:57.110 --> 00:11:00.200
Oh, I'm glad.

00:11:00.410 --> 00:11:03.950
What about you? Are you okay?
You slept so long, I was worried!

00:11:04.160 --> 00:11:05.370
I'm just fine.

00:11:05.580 --> 00:11:06.870
Really?

00:11:07.080 --> 00:11:08.200
Yeah...

00:11:08.410 --> 00:11:12.500
I'm so glad to hear it. I'll be out tomorrow.

00:11:12.710 --> 00:11:14.630
The festival is starting!

00:11:14.840 --> 00:11:15.630
Oh...

00:11:15.840 --> 00:11:18.510
I'm going to see how everyone's
preparations are coming along.

00:11:18.720 --> 00:11:21.090
You just take it easy while I'm gone.

00:11:21.300 --> 00:11:23.470
But you've really been through a lot, too.

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:28.020
I'm okay. I've got to go
and lift everyone's spirits.

00:11:29.520 --> 00:11:33.730
I understand. Good luck with your duties.

00:11:33.940 --> 00:11:35.310
Thanks! Goodnight, then!

00:11:35.520 --> 00:11:36.520
Goodnight.

00:11:41.780 --> 00:11:43.610
Welcome, welcome!

00:11:43.820 --> 00:11:46.160
Is this candy?

00:11:46.370 --> 00:11:48.080
It sure is! Go ahead and try one!

00:11:48.290 --> 00:11:50.790
Would Your Highness care
to try our new creation?

00:11:51.000 --> 00:11:52.870
Empress Yui! Please, take this!

00:11:55.840 --> 00:11:58.550
Empress Yui, this is for you!

00:11:58.760 --> 00:11:59.960
Thank you!

00:12:04.510 --> 00:12:08.460
Delicious Chicken Skewers

00:12:09.140 --> 00:12:10.140
I'll have a green onion skewer...

00:12:10.350 --> 00:12:11.060
Coming up!

00:12:11.270 --> 00:12:14.400
Huh? Hmm?

00:12:16.560 --> 00:12:17.690
Renny!

00:12:17.900 --> 00:12:20.230
I've got a little favor to ask of you...

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:27.370
Great work, Yui.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:29.580
Thanks! What'll we check out next?

00:12:29.790 --> 00:12:33.620
Oh, that's plenty! We've gone
through the whole street!

00:12:33.830 --> 00:12:35.120
But...

00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:39.830
Don't worry about the rest.
Why don't you take a little break?

00:12:40.090 --> 00:12:43.340
All right. Thanks, Aoi!

00:12:45.590 --> 00:12:47.220
Oh, my...

00:12:58.980 --> 00:13:01.230
A-Are you okay?

00:13:01.440 --> 00:13:05.400
Ow, ow... huh? Oh! You're the one on TV!

00:13:05.610 --> 00:13:06.610
Huh?

00:13:07.620 --> 00:13:12.120
So, you want to secretly use
our kitchen to please Yui?

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:15.410
You really are her big sister!

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:20.460
Oh, no. It's just that Yui talked
to me about you before,

00:13:20.670 --> 00:13:23.840
so I was just thinking you
two really are like sisters!

00:13:24.050 --> 00:13:24.670
Huh?

00:13:24.880 --> 00:13:27.550
Hey, stop running! You're going to fall!

00:13:29.970 --> 00:13:31.810
I told you!

00:13:38.150 --> 00:13:40.570
You didn't cry! That's great!

00:13:40.770 --> 00:13:41.770
Yep!

00:13:48.110 --> 00:13:49.200
Am I tough?

00:13:49.410 --> 00:13:50.740
You sure are!

00:13:52.950 --> 00:13:55.750
Were you and Renny like that too?

00:13:55.960 --> 00:14:00.460
Yui cried pretty easily, but she
grew out of that a long time ago.

00:14:02.750 --> 00:14:04.550
Oh, really?

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:08.630
Do you ever miss her a bit,
like as her big sister?

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:11.640
Treating me like a kid again...

00:14:20.730 --> 00:14:22.060
This is heavy!

00:14:22.730 --> 00:14:24.360
Tell me what you're making!

00:14:24.570 --> 00:14:25.530
Nope.

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:28.490
Hey, Retsu! Good to see--

00:14:31.450 --> 00:14:32.780
Tia...

00:14:32.990 --> 00:14:34.700
Do you know each other?

00:14:36.750 --> 00:14:38.620
Thanks!

00:14:38.830 --> 00:14:41.000
Don't forget to disinfect it.

00:14:41.210 --> 00:14:43.790
So, you said you're from another country?

00:14:44.000 --> 00:14:45.250
Yep, I came with Tia!

00:14:45.460 --> 00:14:49.090
Tia, huh? You came in a pair, then. Um...

00:14:49.300 --> 00:14:50.550
I'm Sara!

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:52.510
Sara! I'm--

00:14:52.720 --> 00:14:55.100
Yuinshiel Asteria!

00:14:55.310 --> 00:14:56.890
I saw you in the car!

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:59.060
I can't believe you were on TV; that's crazy!

00:14:59.270 --> 00:15:01.480
Oh, I see. You can just call me Yui.

00:15:01.690 --> 00:15:02.980
Yui!

00:15:03.190 --> 00:15:05.730
The guy with the car said
you're always working really hard,

00:15:05.940 --> 00:15:07.190
and that you're a great person.

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:09.150
Oh, well, I don't know...

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:12.200
If you weren't the Empress,
he'd want you to marry his son!

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.780
Oh! I'm just... you know...

00:15:14.990 --> 00:15:19.250
But he also said you shouldn't
go telling people your three sizes!

00:15:19.460 --> 00:15:22.750
No, that's not it! That was, umm...

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:25.920
You're funny, Yui!

00:15:30.170 --> 00:15:30.920
There you go!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:32.840
Ah, thanks!

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:38.640
Why don't you have some, Tia?

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:40.850
Really? Yay!

00:15:42.600 --> 00:15:44.520
Just until a customer comes, okay?

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:45.730
Yep!

00:15:45.940 --> 00:15:47.610
Where's Sara?

00:15:47.820 --> 00:15:52.150
Um... She's doing "forced labor" or something.

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.280
She says I'm a hostage!

00:15:56.450 --> 00:16:00.500
That's not it, Renny!
We're actually the victims here.

00:16:00.710 --> 00:16:02.120
Sara!

00:16:04.540 --> 00:16:07.800
You always look so scary, Rena. Smile!

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:12.050
Hey, stop that! What're you
doing to my precious little Renny?

00:16:12.260 --> 00:16:16.350
She's not yours, Retsu! Rena isn't bound to you!

00:16:16.550 --> 00:16:17.390
What?!

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:20.930
Retsu! It's about time
you went back to the stall!

00:16:21.140 --> 00:16:22.600
Come on...

00:16:25.480 --> 00:16:29.980
Psh. I thought I was gonna get to
enjoy myself with these adorable girls.

00:16:30.740 --> 00:16:32.650
Bye. bye!

00:16:33.650 --> 00:16:36.950
So, you've been travelling
the world for some time...

00:16:37.160 --> 00:16:38.910
Very impressive for a little one.

00:16:39.120 --> 00:16:42.500
Yep! But some weird person caught us,

00:16:42.710 --> 00:16:45.000
and now they're making us do forced labor!

00:16:45.210 --> 00:16:46.290
Huh?

00:16:46.500 --> 00:16:49.420
They're holding Tia hostage,
so I don't have a choice.

00:16:49.630 --> 00:16:52.340
She must be going through hell right now...

00:16:52.550 --> 00:16:54.340
Yui?

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:56.840
Where is she now?

00:16:57.050 --> 00:16:58.260
Huh?

00:16:58.640 --> 00:16:59.890
"Delicious Chicken Skewers"

00:17:08.150 --> 00:17:11.780
I don't believe it... It was you, Retty!

00:17:11.980 --> 00:17:12.400
Huh?

00:17:12.610 --> 00:17:13.650
You can't do this, Retty!

00:17:13.860 --> 00:17:17.240
Making these little girls work like that!

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:21.450
What? No, you've got it all wrong, Yui!

00:17:21.660 --> 00:17:22.870
I do?

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.330
Sara?

00:17:28.540 --> 00:17:29.630
Eep!

00:17:32.340 --> 00:17:35.630
It's been a while since
we cooked together, Rena!

00:17:40.680 --> 00:17:41.850
Sorry about yesterday...

00:17:44.270 --> 00:17:47.650
Sara said we had to stop you.

00:17:47.850 --> 00:17:49.900
Yeah. Thanks.

00:17:50.110 --> 00:17:51.270
Did you see Kei?

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:55.570
Yeah, but I don't know why
she'd do something like that.

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:58.360
Are you fighting with her?

00:17:58.570 --> 00:18:01.580
Let's take Sara and go to see her!

00:18:01.780 --> 00:18:05.620
After you've made up, we can go home with Sara.

00:18:05.830 --> 00:18:09.630
We'll all live together again, forever!

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:11.170
But I've got Yui...

00:18:11.380 --> 00:18:14.000
Yui? Are you bound to her?

00:18:14.210 --> 00:18:18.710
Just bring her along! You'll be
with her always, just like Sara!

00:18:19.340 --> 00:18:20.720
That would be nice.

00:18:20.930 --> 00:18:21.930
I know!

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:24.890
But Yui... Yui has...

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:26.100
Hm?

00:18:30.980 --> 00:18:33.190
Wow, it's really bustling!

00:18:33.400 --> 00:18:35.230
A skewer sampler, please, Your Highness!

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.900
Thanks for waiting! Here you go!

00:18:38.110 --> 00:18:41.240
It's hot, I'm tired, and I'm hungry!

00:18:41.450 --> 00:18:44.490
Those who do not work shall not eat!
Plus you dine and dash!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:47.040
Sorry! I misunderstood!

00:18:47.250 --> 00:18:50.120
--It's all right! You were tricked, that's all.

00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:52.630
--Hey! Quit spacing out!
--Here you are, thanks for waiting!

00:18:52.840 --> 00:18:55.420
Really... I said you could stay with us until

00:18:55.630 --> 00:18:59.180
you worked off your dinner bill,
and this is what I get?

00:19:00.590 --> 00:19:04.930
Retty, give her a break!
Why don't you rest a bit, Sara?

00:19:05.140 --> 00:19:06.140
Huh?

00:19:07.600 --> 00:19:09.270
--Okay, fine!
--Sorry to keep you waiting! Thank you!

00:19:09.270 --> 00:19:10.270
--All right!

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:20.530
--Here!

00:19:20.530 --> 00:19:22.950
--Thank you, Retsu!

00:19:27.410 --> 00:19:29.870
Ah, I'm pooped!

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:32.290
I hope it wasn't too much
trouble helping out, Yui.

00:19:32.500 --> 00:19:34.420
Not at all, it was really fun!

00:19:34.630 --> 00:19:35.790
You cooked them really well!

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:38.920
Yeah, they were delicious!

00:19:39.130 --> 00:19:40.420
Thanks!

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:43.340
You and your sister both like cooking, huh?

00:19:43.550 --> 00:19:46.010
I wonder what Renny's
cooking over at our place...

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.970
Huh? Rena's at your house, Retty?

00:19:49.180 --> 00:19:51.770
She's probably still there.
Why don't you go see?

00:19:53.770 --> 00:19:56.650
Hey, hey, do you know Rena?

00:19:56.860 --> 00:19:57.860
Huh?

00:20:00.280 --> 00:20:01.150
It's done!

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:02.530
Yay!

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:03.780
--We' re back!
--We' re back!

00:20:03.990 --> 00:20:06.120
Oh! Sara and Retsu are home!

00:20:06.330 --> 00:20:07.830
Hello!

00:20:08.540 --> 00:20:10.580
Rena!

00:20:11.750 --> 00:20:12.540
Sara?

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:16.040
Rena, you've been with Yui!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:19.880
Yui? The Yui you were talking about?

00:20:20.090 --> 00:20:24.590
Ah, yes. I'm Yuinshiel Asteria. Are you Tia?

00:20:24.970 --> 00:20:27.850
Yep! I'm a Regalia, just like Rena!

00:20:28.060 --> 00:20:29.600
Regalia...?

00:20:31.730 --> 00:20:33.440
Huh? Huh?

00:20:34.850 --> 00:20:39.350
So that's it! Yui is Rena's...
That's great, Rena!

00:20:40.030 --> 00:20:43.450
So, Sara and Tia are...

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:49.740
Ah... Ahem! You kind of lost me,
but did you finish it, Rena?

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.410
Yeah.

00:20:53.710 --> 00:20:55.710
"Yui - Thank you for everything"

00:20:56.830 --> 00:20:57.460
Is this it?

00:20:57.670 --> 00:20:59.380
It's been a while, so I thought I'd make one.

00:20:59.590 --> 00:21:01.300
I helped!

00:21:01.510 --> 00:21:05.380
You always work so hard, Yui, so...

00:21:05.590 --> 00:21:07.720
For me?

00:21:07.930 --> 00:21:08.930
Yeah.

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:11.270
Thank you, Rena!

00:21:11.470 --> 00:21:13.230
You too, Tia!

00:21:15.480 --> 00:21:18.690
Wait a sec! Yui, are you the Booby Empress?!

00:21:18.900 --> 00:21:19.150
What?!

00:21:19.360 --> 00:21:23.860
That's right! The super-nice
amazing cook, Booby Empress!

00:21:24.860 --> 00:21:27.490
Now, wait, that's not...

00:21:33.790 --> 00:21:35.790
Aw, you too, Rena?

00:21:42.130 --> 00:21:45.220
Let's stay together forever, big sis!

00:21:48.300 --> 00:21:49.300
Yeah!

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:53.140
All right, let's cut it up!

00:21:53.350 --> 00:21:54.770
Cut me a big piece!

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:56.770
I wanna eat two big ones!

00:21:56.980 --> 00:21:58.350
You two need to calm down!

00:21:58.560 --> 00:21:59.850
Aw, come on!

00:22:00.060 --> 00:22:01.360
Come on, come on!

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:03.360
All right, then I want three big ones!

00:22:03.570 --> 00:22:05.900
Four big ones for me!

00:23:35.950 --> 00:23:40.450
"Feigned Confidence"
